{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Tess, a bunny girl who uses her huge hammer to send enemies flying into other enemies in this top-down bump combat action game! Dodge projectiles, control space and outmaneuver bosses in Arcade mode or explore dungeons, solve puzzles and unlock abilities in Adventure mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/0411b6ad5c0e997979cd38beb2afdf26.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=952 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/0411b6ad5c0e997979cd38beb2afdf26.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/0411b6ad5c0e997979cd38beb2afdf26.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump straight into the action in <strong>Arcade mode</strong>, with difficulty modes suitable for genre newcomers and action game experts. You can fight your way through one stage at a time, attempt to clear the full game in a single credit, or use practice mode to freely practice any tricky checkpoints or boss phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For even more of a challenge, go for a high score. Try to earn an S rank, or maybe even higher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/9e52b190358369dde6fc881104cbf638.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=1170 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/9e52b190358369dde6fc881104cbf638.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/9e52b190358369dde6fc881104cbf638.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the overworld, clear dungeons and solve puzzles in <strong>Adventure mode</strong>. Discover new areas, unlock abilities and uncover secrets as you progress further into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to take on these challenges alone. Up to four players can play together in local or online co-op, using state-of-the-art rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=898 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 12 stages of rocket hammer action in arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for high scores and S ranks on each arcade mode stage, or attempt a full game high score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an overworld and 12 dungeons in adventure mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and play with up to 4 players in local and online co-op (with rollback netcode)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Programming, Design, Art, Music etc.</i> - DUCK_BERET</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Character Design, Key Art</i> - NomnomNami</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605570?t=1772578413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/6088cd8081e4b74fa3e798faa1695b430626c4ae/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772578413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/b45c9089d8e35f519601752b6dc56333cf9248ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772578413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/b45c9089d8e35f519601752b6dc56333cf9248ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772578413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of Tess, a bunny girl who uses