eo/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the overworld, clear dungeons and solve puzzles in <strong>Adventure mode</strong>. Discover new areas, unlock abilities and uncover secrets as you progress further into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/21993edbc281904570ce6b7ffd509145.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to take on these challenges alone. Up to four players can play together in local or online co-op, using state-of-the-art rollback netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.poster.avif?t=1772578413\" width=898 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.webm?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/extras/08388b352ba5d5a056b077aaf5e1ef12.mp4?t=1772578413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 12 stages of rocket hammer action in arcade mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play for high scores and S ranks on each arcade mode stage, or attempt a full game high score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an overworld and 12 dungeons in adventure mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your friends and play with up to 4 players in local and online co-op (with rollback netcode)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Programming, Design, Art, Music etc.</i> - DUCK_BERET</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Character Design, Key Art</i> - NomnomNami</p>","developers":["DUCK_BERET"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605570/411fac1e54ee2586ed318ea8f9f895fe8f0b10a4/header.jpg?t=1772578413","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3605570/734591097/21dc8ade7cbb4f5db5e9a12ad516608b14e43fea/1758301684/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758303683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3605570/734591097/21dc8ade7cbb4f5db5e9a12ad516608b14e43fea/1758301684/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758303683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3605570/734591097/21dc8ade7cbb4f5db5e9a12ad516608b14e43fea/1758301684/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758303683","id":257202195,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202195/b03e9e44ed34e2077a428c7a3f4053dc43c373ef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758303683"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3605570/1855587732/23668549ab519310f6efbb919ac6888d7a132bb9/1757774739/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758290043","